meta {
  name: 03 - Ready
  type: http
  seq: 3
}
get {
  url: {{base_url}}/ready
  auth: none
}
docs {
  Readiness with per-dependency status: anthropic, openemr, document_storage,
  vector_index, reranker.

  status is one of:
    ready     - everything ok
    degraded  - a SOFT dependency is unavailable (openemr / reranker). The
                document path still answers, so this is 200, not 503.
    not_ready - a HARD dependency is down (anthropic / document_storage /
                vector_index). 503.
}
